{"2399480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parcat", "steam_appid": 2399480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you have to break time to find love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an ordinary cat in an extraordinary mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite blanket is gone. The store’s on fire. And your beloved cat-friend has vanished through the window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but curiosity, claws, and questionable physics skills, you’ll parkour across rooftops, knock over everything that stands, and slowly piece together a time machine hidden in your basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, climb, swing, and meow your way through a world where every object can be moved, broken, or used to reach the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fragments of memory to travel back into key moments of the past — and maybe, just maybe, fix the one thing that truly mattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐈 Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Full-body cat physics. Push, drag, swing, and break your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Cinematic parkour. Run, climb, and swing like a feline acrobat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Time-travel puzzles. Gather memory fragments to revisit the past.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you have to break time to find love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an ordinary cat in an extraordinary mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite blanket is gone. The store’s on fire. And your beloved cat-friend has vanished through the window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but curiosity, claws, and questionable physics skills, you’ll parkour across rooftops, knock over everything that stands, and slowly piece together a time machine hidden in your basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, climb, swing, and m